{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Vacant housing units",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Vacant share of all housing units (H1 minus H4's occupied total), cream to deep red -- a 100% count, not the ACS housing collections' pct_vacant_units estimate. Measured over all 240,804 block groups with a published value: 6 classes with breaks at 3%/6%/10%/15%/25%, which fall at the 18th/45th/69th/84th/94th percentile of the national distribution.",
